  "perfect_balance": "per-window perfect balance: every window's nonzero taps spread as evenly as possible over the 4 banks, i.e. max bank = ceil(nnz/4), window = max(ceil(K/4)+1, ceil(COUT/16)*max(1, ceil(nnz/4)), COUT). The only capacity limit is a bank's ceil(K/4) taps (72 on the hidden layers), never binding since ceil(nnz/4) <= ceil(K/4). Each window is balanced on its own, so no static channel-to-bank layout can count less (its max bank is >= ceil(nnz/4) on every window); a layout cannot in general reach it",
